# Guard film (climbing done once for every body, 2026-10-18, docs/plans/climbing-every-body.md): the minor termite up a
# pillar two blocks high, over its top and head first down the far side onto the floor, then away from it, with its
# own body's numbers (its feet, its soft abdomen in segments following the path, its lift and push on the wall). The
# abdomen must follow each edge, never into the stone or out into the air; the body tips over an edge from when its
# front feet reach it until its hind feet are over.
cmd time set noon
cmd weather clear
cmd fill 3 -60 0 3 -59 0 stone
lens 30
walker termite_minor_soldier 0.5 -60 0.5 -90
log minor
cmd tick freeze
fov 10
follow 0 0.15 -7 0 0
go 3 -58 0
burst up 80 1
go 7 -60 0
burst down 80 1
log off
follow off
quit
